cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this survey instrument, please cite it as below."
title: "Migraine, Sleep & Memory: An Adolescent Research Survey"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Bekzod Odilov"
    affiliation: "Specialized School №1, Navoi City"
repository-code: "https://github.com/odilovbj/neuroscience-research"
url: "https://neuroscienceresearch.onrender.com"
abstract: >
  A trilingual (Uzbek, Russian, English) web-based research survey
  investigating whether sleep quality mediates the relationship between
  adolescent migraine and working memory. Combines the ID-Migraine
  screener (Lipton et al., 2003), the Pittsburgh Sleep Quality Index
  (Buysse et al., 1989), and a 2-back working memory task scored via
  signal detection theory.
keywords:
  - migraine
  - sleep
  - working memory
  - adolescent health
  - psychometrics
  - PSQI
  - ID-Migraine
  - n-back task
license: UNLICENSED
date-released: 2026-07-20
